          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This clears the transcript on this iPhone. Conversations kept on your server stay. Delete them under “Past conversations”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This consent can be withdrawn at any time. Enabling shows a note about the data flow; your consent is only given by tapping “Accept”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Zustimmung kann jederzeit widerrufen werden. Beim Aktivieren erscheint ein Hinweis zum Datenfluss; deine Zustimmung wird nur durch Tippen auf „Akzeptieren“ erteilt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This consent can be withdrawn at any time. Enabling shows a note about the data flow; your consent is only given by tapping “Accept”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is still being processed. We'll retry automatically.": {
      "comment": "HLError user-facing copy — audit B-2: the server is still finishing the first request that carried this idempotency key.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird noch verarbeitet. Wird automatisch erneut versucht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is still being processed. We'll retry automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这项仍在处理中。我们会自动重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the first week with enough data for a score. There is nothing before it to compare against yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das ist die erste Woche mit genug Daten für einen Wert. Davor liegt noch nichts zum Vergleichen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the first week with enough data for a score. There is nothing before it to compare against yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是第一个有足够数据形成评分的星期。在它之前还没有可以比较的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the only time the token is displayed. If you lose it, create a new one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Token wird nur dieses eine Mal angezeigt. Wenn du es verlierst, erstelle ein neues."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the only time the token is displayed. If you lose it, create a new one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link is shown only once. We can't show it again — copy or share it now. You can always revoke it later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Link wird nur einmal angezeigt. Wir können ihn nicht erneut anzeigen, also kopiere oder teile ihn jetzt. Du kannst ihn später jederzeit widerrufen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This link is shown only once. We can't show it again, so copy or share it now. You can always revoke it later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个链接只显示一次。我们无法再次显示它，所以请现在复制或分享。你以后随时可以撤销它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This medication is no longer available. It may have been archived or deleted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Medikament ist nicht mehr verfügbar. Es wurde möglicherweise archiviert oder gelöscht."
