            "value": "A sustained elevated-at-rest stretch this afternoon, possibly some tension."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天下午曾有一段静息心率持续偏高的时段，可能有些紧张。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "insights.intraday.tension.evening": {
