    "integration.sync.rateLimited": {
      "comment": "CU-35 (1) — manual sync trigger POST /api/{oura,polar,strava,nightscout}/sync. 429 rate_limited_self, no reset time known. NOT an error tone — it says 'you just did' and names that it works again shortly.",
